msgid ""
"CUAV PW-LINK is an ESP8266 based 2.4Ghz WIFI telemetry radio. It connects to"
" any ArduPilot telemetry port using +5V,gnd,TX and RX signals. Running at "
"the standard default parameters of 57.6 Kbaud and MAVLink2 telemetry "
"protocol, it connects via the standard Mission Planner/ QGC UDP port 14550 "
"over WIFI."
msgstr ""
"CUAV PW-LINK 是基于 ESP8266 的 2.4GHz WIFI 数传电台。它使用 +5V、GND、TX 和 RX 信号连接到任何 "
"ArduPilot 数传端口。以标准默认参数 57.6 Kbaud 和 MAVLink2 数传协议运行，通过标准 Mission Planner/QGC"
" UDP 端口 14550 经 WIFI 连接。"

