#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:19
#: 0f5e226bbb8a44d88346d78dd03f236a 1a3153fcb06741108adbc49cb672b1ad
#: 39e3076865e644678a44d3b3f7587fa3 831c8ff62aa444b98cd5ef590ff6c0bf
#: 9ab24dec6a304e6ebf01961494718d0a e930832d3e8342009fd1e24b2f5b19c3
msgid ""
"Open WIFI connection dialog on PC or Android Phone and select the "
"``CUAVWLINKxxxx`` SSID and connect using the password ``cuavwlink``. Once "
"connected use the UDP connection with port = 14550 (which is default) to "
"connect using Mission Planner. QGC should auto-detect and connect. The PW-"
"LINK default IP address is ``192.168.4.1``."
msgstr ""
"在 PC 或 Android 手机上打开 WIFI 连接对话框，选择 ``CUAVWLINKxxxx`` SSID，使用密码 ``cuavwlink``"
" 连接。连接后，使用端口 = 14550（默认）的 UDP 连接，通过 Mission Planner 连接。QGC 应自动检测并连接。PW-LINK "
"默认 IP 地址为 ``192.168.4.1``。"

